# Hold right through a level skip. The port ignores a button held into a level start until it is released (chuckie.c:218 sets
# button_ack), and that includes the start of the next level, so Henry stays at the start of level 2 while the original walks on.
# The last 40 frames press right again, so a port that never clears the ack after the level change would not move and would differ more.
level 1
5 -
10 right
1 right+skip
30 right
5 -
40 right
